{
    "title": "Guess the Celebrities",
    "description": "Do you like Trivia Games? Do you think you are good at guessing Celebs and Characters? Do you like awesome drawings of celeb people? With Quiz: Celebs Game 2021, Guess the Celebrity you will find everything you are looking for and more! Find out just how much you know!\r\n\r\nQuiz: Celebs Game 2021, Guess the Celebrity! Best trivia in the world.\r\nFree fun game with over 2,000 amazing drawings of popular American and international Celebs\r\n\r\n\u2665 More than 1,000,000 downloads around the world! Thank you! \u2665\r\nPlay now for FREE, the world\u2019s newest and the most popular quiz game.\r\n\r\nQuiz: Celebs Game 2021, Guess the Celebrity FEATURES:\r\n\u2605 Guess over 2000 Celebs and Characters Amazing drawings from all over the world\r\n\u2605 Special American, English, British, Australian and celebrities from many countries levels\r\n\u2605 Complete 50 engaging unique levels\r\n\u2605 With increasing difficulty as you play along\r\n\u2605 Perfect quiz and trivia games for the whole family\r\n\u2605 Invite your friend and gain coins\r\n\u2605 Offline game while you travel\r\n\u2605 Compete with your friends and players from all over the world\r\n\u2605 Use our unique hints to complete levels\r\n\u2605 Keep track of your stats and progress\r\n\u2605 Many languages support\r\n\u2605 High quality celebs and characters drawings\r\n\u2605 And all of that absolutely free\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD NOW FOR FREE\r\n\r\nCompare your answers with your friends!\r\nChallenge them to see who recognise more celebs and characters from the awesome drawings\r\n\r\nNew questions and topics coming soon.\r\nCheck for the updates!",
